---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<title>SetupKaro - Budget Creator & Freelancer Setup India</title>
<meta name="description" content="Free tools + honest budget comparisons for Indian YouTubers and freelancers. Start with mobile + Rs 2000." />
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50 to-white min-h-screen text-gray-900">
<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 text-center">
<div class="text-sm bg-green-100 text-green-700 inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">Made for India • Free tools</div>
<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold mt-4">Start YouTube / Freelancing on a budget</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">No hype. Real prices in INR. Free calculators.</p>
<div class="grid gap-3 mt-6 text-left">
<a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="bg-white border shadow rounded-2xl p-4 block">
<div class="font-bold">💰 Freelance Rate Calculator →</div>
<div class="text-sm text-gray-600">How much to charge/hr with Upwork cut</div>
</a>
<div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm text-gray-500">More tools coming: Mic finder, Budget builder under Rs 5000, Hosting calculator</div>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
